  "title": "Three Sharp Bounds for Hansen Polytopes of Cographs",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4/Mathlib formalisation of three sharp lower bounds for Hansen polytopes of finite nonempty cographs: normalized Mahler volume at least one, at least 3^d nonempty faces, and at least 2^d d! full flags in dimension d. In each result equality holds exactly for threshold graphs.",
